<title>FRANCE: Emery appoints sales manager for France.</title>
<headline>Emery appoints sales manager for France.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emery Worldwide has appointed Christian Ranchon as sales manager for France.</p>
<p>Ranchon was station director at forwarding group MSAS Cargo at Paris-Orly airport, and fills a post previously held by Jean-Jacques Prevost, an Emery official said.</p>
<p>Emery's French network includes a new satellite office in Chartres and service centres in Bordeaux, Lille, Lyon, Marseille, Mulhouse, Nice, Paris, Strasbourg and Toulouse. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+44 171 542-5017</p>
